    <DataNode elementId="AT1G08510-MONOMER" textLabel="AT1G08510-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9SJE2" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="750" centerY="515" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">There are two families of acyl-ACP thioesterase in plants - |FRAME: EG10273 fabA| and |FRAME: EG10274 fabB|. Substrate specificity of these isoforms determines the chain length and level of saturated fatty acids in plants. The highest activity of |FRAME: EG10273 fabA| is with |FRAME: Oleoyl-ACPs an oleoyl-[acp]| (C18:1-[acp]). FatA has very low activities towards other acyl-[acp]s when compared with oleyl-[acp]. |FRAME: AT1G08510 FatB| has highest activity with |FRAME: Palmitoyl-ACPs a palmitoyl-[acp]| (C16:0-[acp]). It also has significant high activity with |FRAME: Oleoyl-ACPs an oleoyl-[acp]|, followed by |FRAME: Stearoyl-ACPs a stearoyl-[acp]| (C18:0-[acp]) and |FRAME: Palmitoleoyl-ACPs a palmitoleoyl-[acp]| (C16:1-[acp]). Kinetics studies of the Arabidopsis FatA and FatB indicate that their substrate specificities with different acyl-[acp]s came from the Kcat values, rather than from Km. The Km values of the two isoforms with different substrates are similar, in the micromolar order. Domain swapping of FatA and FatB indicates the N-terminus of the isoforms determines their substrate specificities.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G08510-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT1G08510.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9SJE2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR029069" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF12590" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="Q9SJE2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="Q9SJE2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9SJE2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33599, RXN-16673, RXN-12649" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="3" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0009536" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G08510.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G08510" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="12061798" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <Property key="Locations" value="CCO-PLASTID" />
    </DataNode>
